            "block_content": "SIDE LETTER AGREEMENT\nBETWEEN THE UNIVERSITY OF CALIFORNIA AND THE\nAMERICAN FEDERATION OF STATE, COUNTY, AND MUNICIPAL EMPLOYEES\n(AFSCME) REGARDING THE CAPITAL ACCUMULATION PROVISION (CAP)",
